---
manual: rules.redirection.slot_editing_stack
lines: [246, 267]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  stack do
    para "First"
    para "Second"
    para "Third"
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_equal %w[First Second Third], stack.contents.map(&:text), "drawing inside the block is redirected to the stack"
assert_equal [stack.linkable_id], Shoes.APPS.first.document_root.contents.map(&:linkable_id),
  "nothing lands in the App's top slot"
